DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8549::$$$message_0062_0000_0000$$$::"Oh..."[lr]::
8550::$$$message_0062_0000_0001$$$::I hear the sound of sharp movement from the dojo.[lr]::
8551::$$$message_0062_0000_0002$$$::Is it the middle of the kyudo club's weekend practice?[lr]::
8552::$$$message_0062_0000_0003$$$::It's been a while since I quit the club, but I stop like this when I hear the sound of vibrating bowstrings.::
8553::$$$message_0062_0001_0000$$$::"...Maybe I'll go watch a little..."[lr]::
8554::$$$message_0062_0001_0001$$$::It's before their tournament, but I can leave if I seem to be a distraction.[lr]::
8555::$$$message_0062_0001_0002$$$::Sakura or Fuji-nee are there too, so it should be no problem to watch.::
8556::$$$message_0062_0002_0000$$$::"Excuse me. I'm Emiya, a third year, but I came to[line len=2]"[lr]::
8557::$$$message_0062_0002_0001$$$::"Oh, Emiya. I'm surprised you came."[lr]::
8558::$$$message_0062_0002_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri, the former captain, returns my greeting.[lr]::
8559::$$$message_0062_0002_0003$$$::When I look for other familiar faces...::
8560::$$$message_0062_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8561::$$$message_0062_0003_0001$$$::Sakura, the captain, lightly gives a silent bow.[lr]::
8562::$$$message_0062_0003_0002$$$::They must be busy, as they don't come running over here.[lr]::
8563::$$$message_0062_0003_0003$$$::Fuji-nee, the advisor, must be absent.::
8564::$$$message_0062_0004_0000$$$::"I came to watch, can I come in?"[lr]::
8565::$$$message_0062_0004_0001$$$::"How rare to come watch our weekend practice.[lr]::
8566::$$$message_0062_0004_0002$$$::Even some of our members skip it."[lr]::
8567::$$$message_0062_0004_0003$$$::She says that, but there seems to be around the same number of members present as weekdays. The atmosphere of the dojo is filled with tension before the tournament.::
8568::$$$message_0062_0005_0000$$$::"Is it time for intense training soon? If I'm a distraction, I'll excuse myself."[lr]::
8569::$$$message_0062_0005_0001$$$::"It's fine; those who come are welcome is our club's tradition.[lr]::
8570::$$$message_0062_0005_0002$$$::Come in, Emiya."[lr]::
8571::$$$message_0062_0005_0003$$$::"Okay... Excuse me."[lr]::
8572::$$$message_0062_0005_0004$$$::I take off my shoes and go on the wooden floor of the archery range.::
8573::$$$message_0062_0006_0000$$$::"Here you go."[lr]::
8574::$$$message_0062_0006_0001$$$::"Oh, thanks."[lr]::
8575::$$$message_0062_0006_0002$$$::We go along the wall, and I sit in the back corner of the waiting area.::
8576::$$$message_0062_0007_0000$$$::"You're fine without a cushion, right?"[lr]::
8577::$$$message_0062_0007_0001$$$::I feel like some of the members were made self-conscious by my presence, but everyone is so absorbed in their practice that they don't try to overtly look this way.::
8578::$$$message_0062_0008_0000$$$::"So, what brought you to come by on a day off?[lr]::
8579::$$$message_0062_0008_0001$$$::What, did you feel like your own self training wasn't enough?"[lr]::
8580::$$$message_0062_0008_0002$$$::"No, there's really no deep meaning. I just came by on a whim."::
8581::$$$message_0062_0009_0000$$$::"Wow. I thought you couldn't stay away from your bow any longer that you had to come here."[lr]::
8582::$$$message_0062_0009_0001$$$::"I wouldn't have come empty-handed if that were the case. I do take care of my bow and arrow even now, too."::
8583::$$$message_0062_0010_0000$$$::"I see. Well, I guess it's good if you feel up to it at least once before graduation. I need to settle this with you, or else I feel uneasy."[lr]::
8584::$$$message_0062_0010_0001$$$::"...Mrgh. I want to deal with things properly, but when it comes to this, I don't think anything can be done about it."[lr]::
8585::$$$message_0062_0010_0002$$$::It's the matter of how I'm feeling.[lr]::
8586::$$$message_0062_0010_0003$$$::I wonder if people with mental trauma also feel like this.::
8587::$$$message_0062_0011_0000$$$::"Geez, I hope you haven't gotten rusty and have to review starting from kyudo stretches.[lr]::
8588::$$$message_0062_0011_0001$$$::Oh..."[lr]::
8589::$$$message_0062_0011_0002$$$::I follow Mitsuzuri's gaze as she smiles bitterly.::
8590::$$$message_0062_0012_0000$$$::"Yamazaki? When you release the arrow, your shooting form collapses."[lr]::
8591::$$$message_0062_0012_0001$$$::"...Okay."[lr]::
8592::$$$message_0062_0012_0002$$$::"Instead of trying to create fluid movement with your wrist[line len=2]If you make the movement of your left thumb natural, the bowstring will return so don't try to force it."[lr]::
8593::$$$message_0062_0012_0003$$$::"Yes, Captain Matou."::
8594::$$$message_0062_0013_0000$$$::"I think you raise your bow too early, Fujiki.[lr]::
8595::$$$message_0062_0013_0001$$$::Try doing it more like...like how steam rises, does that make sense?"[lr]::
8596::$$$message_0062_0013_0002$$$::"I see, understood."::
8597::$$$message_0062_0014_0000$$$::"Miss Owaki, you're leaning backwards.[lr]::
8598::$$$message_0062_0014_0001$$$::You should stay calm and check your form in the mirror later."[lr]::
8599::$$$message_0062_0014_0002$$$::"Yes, Captain."::
8600::$$$message_0062_0015_0000$$$::"...Wow."[lr]::
8601::$$$message_0062_0015_0001$$$::Sakura instructs the members efficiently.[lr]::
8602::$$$message_0062_0015_0002$$$::I feel like she's way different than usual.::
8603::$$$message_0062_0016_0000$$$::"Hey, Mitsuzuri?"[lr]::
8604::$$$message_0062_0016_0001$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
8605::$$$message_0062_0016_0002$$$::I ask in a low voice so that the others don't hear me.::
8606::$$$message_0062_0017_0000$$$::"Was Sakura always this resolute?"[lr]::
8607::$$$message_0062_0017_0001$$$::"Well, what did you think Matou was doing?"[lr]::
8608::$$$message_0062_0017_0002$$$::She asks me in return, and I scratch my chin.[lr]::
8609::$$$message_0062_0017_0003$$$::When I imagine Sakura as a captain from how she usually is...::
8610::$$$message_0062_0018_0000$$$::"...I pictured her lacking authority, bearing all the hardships all by herself, and going around in circles fighting a lone battle..."[lr]::
8611::$$$message_0062_0018_0001$$$::"Mm... Well, she was like that when she took over in the beginning."[lr]::
8612::$$$message_0062_0018_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri sighs, as if she's remembered something.::
8613::$$$message_0062_0019_0000$$$::"At first, I was worried that the burden was too much for Matou, or it would amount to something.[lr]::
8614::$$$message_0062_0019_0001$$$::I've been trying to subtly help out without meddling too much[line len=2]"::
8615::$$$message_0062_0020_0000$$$::"Well anyway, my judgment was correct.[lr]::
8616::$$$message_0062_0020_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=美綴弓道着01b(中) time=300]Matou has grown to the point that she's unrecognizable and is now the face of the kyudo club as you can see."[lr]::
8617::$$$message_0062_0020_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri smirks like a craftsman boasting of their work.::
8618::$$$message_0062_0021_0000$$$::I was surprised when I first heard that Sakura was going to become the kyudo captain.[lr]::
8619::$$$message_0062_0021_0001$$$::Since then, I couldn't hear much about it from Sakura, since she seemed busy. It's unexpected that she's become this admirable, but I'm also glad.::
8620::$$$message_0062_0022_0000$$$::"Next is the third years' practice."[lr]::
8621::$$$message_0062_0022_0001$$$::"Oh, it's our turn.[lr]::
8622::$$$message_0062_0022_0002$$$::Admire my radiance from there, Emiya."[lr]::
8623::$$$message_0062_0022_0003$$$::Mitsuzuri stands up right away and heads to the shooting area.[lr]::
8624::$$$message_0062_0022_0004$$$::Just as I was thinking that her confident state is as expected of her...::
8625::$$$message_0062_0023_0000$$$::"Oh, Sakura."[lr]::
8626::$$$message_0062_0023_0001$$$::"Thank you for coming to watch on a day off, Emiya-senpai."[lr]::
8627::$$$message_0062_0023_0002$$$::She comes to the waiting area and takes a deep bow.::
8628::$$$message_0062_0024_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8629::$$$message_0062_0024_0001$$$::My eyes are wide with astonishment.[lr]::
8630::$$$message_0062_0024_0002$$$::The Sakura here was not the Sakura at home, but Captain Matou of the kyudo club.::
8631::$$$message_0062_0025_0000$$$::"...What's wrong, Senpai?"[lr]::
8632::$$$message_0062_0025_0001$$$::I must've been too stunned, as she whispers in a quiet voice.::
8633::$$$message_0062_0026_0000$$$::"Um, did I say something weird?"[lr]::
8634::$$$message_0062_0026_0001$$$::"No, nothing. I wasn't mentally prepared, even though you greeted me politely."[lr]::
8635::$$$message_0062_0026_0002$$$::"Huh...?"::
8636::$$$message_0062_0027_0000$$$::"Man, I'm impressed.[lr]::
8637::$$$message_0062_0027_0001$$$::You've gotten quite used to being the captain."[lr]::
8638::$$$message_0062_0027_0002$$$::"Really? Me?"[lr]::
8639::$$$message_0062_0027_0003$$$::"Now that you're the kyudo club captain, ah..."::
8640::$$$message_0062_0028_0000$$$::"Yes, I got a lot of help from Mitsuzuri-senpai and others in the beginning.[lr]::
8641::$$$message_0062_0028_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=桜弓道着01b(中) time=300]Thanks to that, I'm a bit more put together, but for you to say that too[line len=2]"[lr]::
8642::$$$message_0062_0028_0002$$$::"Captain Matou!"[lr]::
8643::$$$message_0062_0028_0003$$$::It was in the middle of our conversation, but there's a voice calling for Sakura from the archery range.[lr]::
8644::$$$message_0062_0028_0004$$$::That voice is... Oh, it's Mitsuzuri's little brother. He's glaring over here for some reason.::
8645::$$$message_0062_0029_0000$$$::"I'm sorry, the first years are..."[lr]::
8646::$$$message_0062_0029_0001$$$::"It's fine, your duties as captain are more important."[lr]::
8647::$$$message_0062_0029_0002$$$::I send Sakura off.[lr]::
8648::$$$message_0062_0029_0003$$$::The moment she stands up, she returns to her sharp kyudo club captain face.[lr]::
8649::$$$message_0062_0029_0004$$$::Sakura silently bows, and I bow back.::
8650::$$$message_0062_0030_0000$$$::"...Emiya-senpai?"[lr]::
8651::$$$message_0062_0030_0001$$$::Sakura looks back as she heads to the straw practice target.::
8652::$$$message_0062_0031_0000$$$::"What?"[lr]::
8653::$$$message_0062_0031_0001$$$::"Um, it's hard to talk here, so... Would you like to go home together after practice is over?[lr]::
8654::$$$message_0062_0031_0002$$$::That is, if you can stay until the rest of practice, but..."::
8655::$$$message_0062_0032_0000$$$::"Sure. I'll wait until you finish, so please carry out your captain duties."[lr]::
8656::$$$message_0062_0032_0001$$$::"Yes. I will see you later then, Senpai..."::
8657::$$$message_0062_0033_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8658::$$$message_0062_0033_0001$$$::Sakura has changed a lot.[lr]::
8659::$$$message_0062_0033_0002$$$::When she came to our place, she always looked down and didn't laugh.[lr]::
8660::$$$message_0062_0033_0003$$$::She became more outgoing...because of Fuji-nee.::
8661::$$$message_0062_0034_0000$$$::"If it weren't for Fuji-nee, I also..."[lr]::
8662::$$$message_0062_0034_0001$$$::When I was taken in by Kiritsugu, I would fight with Fuji-nee, who was still a crybaby, sometimes.[lr]::
8663::$$$message_0062_0034_0002$$$::But more than that, there were more times that Fuji-nee cheered me up.::
8664::$$$message_0062_0035_0000$$$::The fact that Sakura is able to carry through as a kyudo club captain must also be from Fuji-nee's guidance.[lr]::
8665::$$$message_0062_0035_0001$$$::Fuji-nee is like a goddess of fortune that is essential to our house after all[line len=2]::
8666::$$$message_0062_0036_0000$$$::"Hiii everyone!"[lr]::
8667::$$$message_0062_0036_0001$$$::"Hey Ms. Fujimura!"[lr]::
8668::$$$message_0062_0036_0002$$$::"Hey, are you guys practicing till you die?[lr]::
8669::$$$message_0062_0036_0003$$$::Ohh? Even former member Shirou is here, did you come to hang out?"::
8670::$$$message_0062_0037_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
8671::$$$message_0062_0037_0001$$$::...She hasn't changed at all.[lr]::
8672::$$$message_0062_0037_0002$$$::Everyone's shining idol advisor who would be full of energy even if the world was about to end, Taiga Fujimura, appeared.::
8673::$$$message_0062_0038_0000$$$::"...Ms. Fujimura, hello. Excuse me for intruding."[lr]::
8674::$$$message_0062_0038_0001$$$::"Well, make yourself at home, Emiya. Although I'm afraid we don't have any tea to welcome you."[lr]::
8675::$$$message_0062_0038_0002$$$::"It's fine, everyone is working hard towards the tournament[line len=2]"[lr]::
8676::$$$message_0062_0038_0003$$$::"Hey, can someone bring some tea?"[lr]::
8677::$$$message_0062_0038_0004$$$::"...So you simply just wanted to drink some yourself..."::
8678::$$$message_0062_0039_0000$$$::The club advisor nods.[lr]::
8679::$$$message_0062_0039_0001$$$::...I don't see a single sign of the remarkable guidance that led Sakura.[lr]::
8680::$$$message_0062_0039_0002$$$::She's the same as the Fuji-nee at home after all.::
8681::$$$message_0062_0040_0000$$$::"...I think I'll pass. More than that[line len=2]"[lr]::
8682::$$$message_0062_0040_0001$$$::"Could it be [cacheimage storage=藤05a(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=藤05a(中) time=400]that you still want to come admire all the beauties we have here, despite having so many cute girls at home?[lr]::
8683::$$$message_0062_0040_0002$$$::Could I be the one you have your eye on!?"::
8684::$$$message_0062_0041_0000$$$::"........."[lr]::
8685::$$$message_0062_0041_0001$$$::How do I put this?[lr]::
8686::$$$message_0062_0041_0002$$$::Having firm policies under that initially deceptive carefree attitude, and Sakura being able to grasp that... How is that possible?::
8687::$$$message_0062_0042_0000$$$::"When you were small, you always got to see me in my kendo uniform. Do you get excited seeing girls in hakama because of that?[lr]::
8688::$$$message_0062_0042_0001$$$::Do you? You do, huh?[cacheimage storage=藤04a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=藤04a(中)] Ahhh! Run away! All the first-year girls, run away!"::
8689::$$$message_0062_0043_0000$$$::"Ms. Fujimura!"[lr]::
8690::$$$message_0062_0043_0001$$$::A yell echoes throughout the archery range.::
8691::$$$message_0062_0044_0000$$$::"Sa... Sakura..."[lr]::
8692::$$$message_0062_0044_0001$$$::"Ms. Fujimura, this is a sacred dojo.[lr]::
8693::$$$message_0062_0044_0002$$$::I would like you to refrain from talking about impure things about boys and girls."[lr]::
8694::$$$message_0062_0044_0003$$$::"Wa... Wahhhh..."::
8695::$$$message_0062_0045_0000$$$::"Besides, please be aware that you are also an educator.[lr]::
8696::$$$message_0062_0045_0001$$$::Even if Emiya-senpai is a former member, it will set a bad example to the members if you are being too informal to him."[lr]::
8697::$$$message_0062_0045_0002$$$::"Oof..."::
8698::$$$message_0062_0046_0000$$$::...Wow.[lr]::
8699::$$$message_0062_0046_0001$$$::Sakura is really talking Fuji-nee down.::
8700::$$$message_0062_0047_0000$$$::"I apologize about our advisor causing you trouble."[lr]::
8701::$$$message_0062_0047_0001$$$::She had saved me from getting teased, but I can't light-heartedly thank Sakura who is angry.::
8702::$$$message_0062_0048_0000$$$::"It's as usual, so I don't mind."[lr]::
8703::$$$message_0062_0048_0001$$$::"No, I must apologize to you as the captain[line len=2]"[lr]::
8704::$$$message_0062_0048_0002$$$::"Captain Matou!"[lr]::
8705::$$$message_0062_0048_0003$$$::Mitsuzuri's little brother calls for her just in time.[lr]::
8706::$$$message_0062_0048_0004$$$::...But why is he glaring at me?::
8707::$$$message_0062_0049_0000$$$::"I am deeply sorry."[lr]::
8708::$$$message_0062_0049_0001$$$::"Matou, good work. You should go to Minori."[lr]::
8709::$$$message_0062_0049_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri swaps places with her.[lr]::
8710::$$$message_0062_0049_0003$$$::She sits next to me formally, but I get a somehow careless vibe from her.::
8711::$$$message_0062_0050_0000$$$::"Matou can also tell Ms. Fujimura off.[lr]::
8712::$$$message_0062_0050_0001$$$::I think she's a more admirable captain than me, even just in that sense."[lr]::
8713::$$$message_0062_0050_0002$$$::"Oddly, you seem to take a step back from Fuji-nee."::
8714::$$$message_0062_0051_0000$$$::"Well, she is a living legend of Homurahara.[lr]::
8715::$$$message_0062_0051_0001$$$::She has the respectable skills that I would never be a match for in this field."[lr]::
8716::$$$message_0062_0051_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri grips the hilt of a bamboo sword and swings it around.[lr]::
8717::$$$message_0062_0051_0003$$$::It must be the effect from belonging to a hierarchical society where your strength determines how much influence you have.::
8718::$$$message_0062_0052_0000$$$::"Sakura was [font italic=true]my[font italic=false] minion that I took care of and looked after!"[lr]::
8719::$$$message_0062_0052_0001$$$::"Ah, Ms. Fujimura!?"[lr]::
8720::$$$message_0062_0052_0002$$$::"But the moment she becomes captain, she revolts against me and overthrows me! She became a sad girl that doesn't listen to me anymore..."::
8721::$$$message_0062_0053_0000$$$::"My plans for the kyudo club fell through when you left the club two years ago.[lr]::
8722::$$$message_0062_0053_0001$$$::I thought Sakura was the perfect person for my second plan this year... [cacheimage storage=藤10b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=藤10b(中) pos=l time=300]Now she's just my nemesis."[lr]::
8723::$$$message_0062_0053_0002$$$::"S-so you were pushing for Sakura for that reason?"::
8724::$$$message_0062_0054_0000$$$::"That's why I wanted the leading figure, Miss Mitsuzuri, to be my guardian and protect me from Sakura."[lr]::
8725::$$$message_0062_0054_0001$$$::"E-even if you say that... [cacheimage storage=美綴弓道着02e(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=美綴弓道着02e(中) time=300]I'm going to retire soon, so I was going to keep from interfering."::
8726::$$$message_0062_0055_0000$$$::"Exactly, if you graduate, then I'll be bullied by Sakura every day!"[lr]::
8727::$$$message_0062_0055_0001$$$::"I'll leave Minori behind for when that happens, so please use him as a shield or a stand-in or a human sacrifice."::
8728::$$$message_0062_0056_0000$$$::"I can't, Minori has already long been Sakura's doll![lr]::
8729::$$$message_0062_0056_0001$$$::You're not a cruel pupil who would overlook your mentor's crisis, right? Right?"[lr]::
8730::$$$message_0062_0056_0002$$$::"Haah... Well, no."::
8731::$$$message_0062_0057_0000$$$::"D-don't lose to her, Mitsuzuri!"[lr]::
8732::$$$message_0062_0057_0001$$$::"E-Emiya..."[lr]::
8733::$$$message_0062_0057_0002$$$::"The future of the kyudo club is in your hands!"[lr]::
8734::$$$message_0062_0057_0003$$$::"Oh yeah, if you switch with me until graduation...!"[lr]::
8735::$$$message_0062_0057_0004$$$::"W-were you trying to convince me for two years for that reason?"[lr]::
8736::$$$message_0062_0057_0005$$$::"N-no, that's not the only reason..."::
8737::$$$message_0062_0058_0000$$$::"Ms. Fujimura!"[lr]::
8738::$$$message_0062_0058_0001$$$::"Yes!"[lr]::
8739::$$$message_0062_0058_0002$$$::"I can't have the advisor being like this at such an important time before our tournament[line len=2][cacheimage storage=桜弓道着03k(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜弓道着03k(中)]What are you also doing here, Mitsuzuri-senpai!?"::
8740::$$$message_0062_0059_0000$$$::"I haven't done anything![lr]::
8741::$$$message_0062_0059_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=美綴弓道着02a(中) time=300]And Matou, I told you to always hold onto the reins of the advisor if you're a captain."[lr]::
8742::$$$message_0062_0059_0002$$$::"Um, that is..."[lr]::
8743::$$$message_0062_0059_0003$$$::"Wait, is that really a duty of the captain?"::
8744::$$$message_0062_0060_0000$$$::"When are you going to break out of your shell? Get out of your rookie mindset!"[lr]::
8745::$$$message_0062_0060_0001$$$::"Yes, I'm sorry!"[lr]::
8746::$$$message_0062_0060_0002$$$::"Nice, go Ayako!"::
8747::$$$message_0062_0061_0000$$$::"Please don't be ridiculous, this is because you are irresponsible, Ms. Fujimura!"[lr]::
8748::$$$message_0062_0061_0001$$$::"Ahhh! Sakura is scary!"[lr]::
8749::$$$message_0062_0061_0002$$$::"That's the spirit, don't be relying on the third years forever."::
8750::$$$message_0062_0062_0000$$$::"Help me, Miss Mitsuzuri! Is overlooking your mentor's crisis your martial arts spirit, you insensitive person!?"[lr]::
8751::$$$message_0062_0062_0001$$$::"B-but the spirituality of kyudo is selflessness!"[lr]::
8752::$$$message_0062_0062_0002$$$::"Ms. Fujimura, that is cowardly of you to put it on her like that!"::
8753::$$$message_0062_0063_0000$$$::"Th...this is[line len=2]"[lr]::
8754::$$$message_0062_0063_0001$$$::"Please do not cause me trouble, Ms. Fujimura!"[lr]::
8755::$$$message_0062_0063_0002$$$::"Don't leave me alone, Miss Mitsuzuri!"[lr]::
8756::$$$message_0062_0063_0003$$$::"Let me be free, Captain Matou!"[lr]::
8757::$$$message_0062_0063_0004$$$::Before I knew it, there's some power balance like rock paper scissors being built.::
8758::$$$message_0062_0064_0000$$$::"...You all seem busy, so I'll excuse myself."[lr]::
8759::$$$message_0062_0064_0001$$$::"Y-yes, Senpai. Next time, let[line len=2]"[lr]::
8760::$$$message_0062_0064_0002$$$::"Emiya, take Ms. Fujimura with you!"[lr]::
8761::$$$message_0062_0064_0003$$$::"Shirou, bring back the docile Sakura!"[lr]::
8762::$$$message_0062_0064_0004$$$::"Ms. [wvl canskip=0 time=200]Fu[wvl canskip=0 time=200]ji[wvl canskip=0 time=200]mu[wvl canskip=0 time=200]raaa!"[lr]::
8763::$$$message_0062_0064_0005$$$::"Wah!"::
8764::$$$message_0062_0065_0000$$$::"Oh, Senpai![lr]::
8765::$$$message_0062_0065_0001$$$::Please wait at the gate!"[lr]::
8766::$$$message_0062_0065_0002$$$::"Captain Matou!!!"[lr]::
8767::$$$message_0062_0065_0003$$$::...What is with this club?::
908750::$$$message_9062_0062_0000$$$::"Help me, Miss Mitsuzuri! Is overlooking your mentor's crisis your martial arts spirit, you insensitive person!?"[r]::
�